*CHIPBIN* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

ChipLang binary bundle format specification

All multi-byte integers are little-endian.
Strings are length-prefixed: uint32 length + UTF-8 bytes.


*Offset   Size       Type            Description*
------   ----       ----            -----------
0        16         bytes           Shebang (#!/usr/bin/chippy\n)
16       7          bytes           Magic bytes (CHIPBIN)
23       1          uint8           Format version (currently 1)
24       4+N        string          Project name
         4+N        string          Version
         4+N        string          ChipLang version
         8          uint64          Bundle ID
         1          uint8           Has plugins (0=no, 1=yes)
         [4+N]      string          Target OS (only if has plugins)
         [4+N]      string          Target arch (only if has plugins)
         8+N        bytes           Program (uint64 size + bytes)
         4          uint32          Number of files
         varies     table           File table (see below)
         varies     bytes           File data (concatenated)

File Table Entry (repeated for each file):
         4+N        string          Filename
         1          uint8           Type (1=plugin, 2=asset)
         8          uint64          File size in bytes

See ''chippy doc bundles'' for bundle usage.
